---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

// SPRINT A PLACEHOLDER — the live Squarespace privacy policy has issues
// (CCPA-section, "Marketing and promotional purposes", outdated Apr 2024).
// Phase 5 rewrites this from scratch using the 10-point structure from
// plan-section 5.4. For Sprint A we have a minimal-but-honest placeholder
// that points at office@ for data-subject requests and lists Cloudflare/
// GitHub as processors.
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy – everyone codes"
  description="Privacy policy of everyone codes gGmbH — how we handle visitor data on everyonecodes.io."
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p class="lede">
        everyone codes gGmbH ("we", "us") takes the privacy of visitors to our website
        seriously. This page explains what data we collect, why, and what your rights
        are under the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
      </p>

      <!--
        TODO Phase 5 — full rewrite with Ecovis review.
        Source: docs/plans/website-replatform/legal-from-squarespace.md
        Problems with the live Squarespace version (must NOT carry over):
          1. CCPA section — irrelevant for an AT NGO, generic template noise
          2. "Marketing and promotional purposes" — contradicts our no-tracker stance
          3. Outdated stand date (24.04.2024)
          4. No concrete retention periods
          5. Processors not listed
          6. No mention of the right to lodge a complaint
          7. No Spendenbegünstigung note (Finanzonline reporting)
      -->

      <h2>1. Controller</h2>
      <p>
        everyone codes gGmbH, Muthgasse 58/60, 1190 Vienna, Austria. Email:
        <a href="mailto:office@everyonecodes.io">office@everyonecodes.io</a>.
        Full company details in the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/imprint`}>Imprint</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What data we process</h2>
      <p>
        Our site is intentionally lean: <strong>we use no third-party analytics, no
        marketing cookies, and no tracking pixels</strong>. The data we do process:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Server logs</strong> (IP address, browser type, requested URL,
          timestamp) — automatically processed by our hosting provider for operational
          security. Not used for analytics.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Contact data you provide</strong> when you email us (name, email,
          message content) — used only to respond to your inquiry.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Donation data</strong> when you donate and ask us to file a
          Spendenbegünstigung report (name, date of birth, address, amount) — submitted
          to Finanzonline as required by Austrian tax law (§ 4a EStG).
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Processors we use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> (EU datacenters) — content delivery and DDoS
          protection. <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>GitHub</strong> (Microsoft Ireland) — repository hosting. Static site
          assets are served from this infrastructure during the Sprint-A phase.
          <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>Both have signed standard Data Processing Agreements (DPAs).</p>

      <h2>4. Your rights under GDPR</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the data we hold about you (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
        <li>Rectification of inaccurate data (Art. 16)</li>
        <li>Erasure (Art. 17)</li>
        <li>Restriction of processing (Art. 18)</li>
        <li>Data portability (Art. 20)</li>
        <li>Object to processing (Art. 21)</li>
        <li>
          Lodge a complaint with the Austrian Data Protection Authority
          (<a href="https://www.dsb.gv.at/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dsb.gv.at</a>)
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise any of these rights, email us at
        <a href="mailto:office@everyonecodes.io">office@everyonecodes.io</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Server logs are kept for 30 days. Email correspondence is kept as long as
        operationally relevant (typically 2 years). Donation data is kept for 7 years
        as required by Austrian tax law.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Children</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect
        personal data from minors.
      </p>

      <p class="last-updated">
        Last updated: 2026-05-31 &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <em>Full review and update by Ecovis is planned for Phase 5 of our website
        relaunch.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 80px 24px;
    min-height: 60vh;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 48px);
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 26px);
    color: var(--magenta);
    margin: 36px 0 14px;
  }
  p,
  li {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--violet);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  a:hover {
    color: var(--magenta);
  }
  .last-updated {
    margin-top: 56px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding-top: 16px;
  }
</style>
